WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:04,160
Mr. Li, you have never let Master Gu look at you, right?

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:09,810
Send an order to the whole army

3
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:12,210
Before sunset, take the Dingyuan Line

4
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,670
Upgrade Zhao Ling

5
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:15,130
General, wait a minute.

6
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,010
Something is terribly wrong

7
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:20,130
There must be something wrong with the Holy Bureau.

8
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:21,510
General, please see

9
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,130
The so-called Tigerless General of the Fish Army

10
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:24,630
Now only Zhao Guang appears in Chengtou

11
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,510
Ma Wei and the three black bear waists

12
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,310
The remaining two yuan warriors are missing

13
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:29,770
Especially the hand known as the tiger-free hand

14
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:30,970
Li Hao, who possesses the power of the Overlord

15
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,170
Never showed up since

16
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:33,770
If this person is not in the city

17
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,220
Where can I go?

18
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,160
Li Hao is not in town

19
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:44,500
General leader

20
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,500
Our rear area was penetrated by the Holy Spirit.

21
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,000
Wanshou camp

22
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,200
Looking back at the humanoid tyrannosaurus riding a white tiger

23
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,800
It's the hand of a big fish without a tiger

24
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,500
Li Hao is back
